                '---------------'

                DESCRIPTION:

                    SidebarRail is a container element which hosts the tabs
                    and groups used for the navigation experience of panels.

                    Sidebar will manage the creation of a SidebarRail, but one can be manually created if desired.

                    SidebarRail can be instantiated in one of three ways:

                        1. Using the SidebarRail constructor

                            let container = document.getElementById('container');
                            const properties = {
                                placeholder: 'Dummy Text'
                            };
                            const sidebarRail = SidebarRail(properties);
                            container.appendChild(sidebarRail);

                        2. Using the createElement API

                            const container = document.querySelector('#container');
                            let sidebarRail = document.createElement('mw-sidebar-rail');

                            sidebarRail.placeholder = 'Dummy Text';

                            container.appendChild(sidebarRail);

                        3. Using HTML

                            <div id="container" style="width:400px;height:30px;background-color:blue">
                                <mw-sidebar-rail></mw-sidebar-rail>
                            </div>

                PROPERTIES:

                    orientation - (default: 'vertical') sets the fixed and free dimensions of the rail [ vertical | horizontal ]
                    showpanelsgallerybutton - (default: false) shows a meatballs button in the rail

                EVENTS:

                    showpanelsgallery - emitted when the Panels Gallery Button is clicked
            `}static get styles(){return[super.styles,c`
                    :host {
                        display: flex;
                        width: 100%;
                        height: 100%;
                        background-color: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-background-color, #D9D9D9);
                        flex-grow: 0;
                        flex-shrink: 0;
                    }

                    .hostContainer {
                        display: flex;
                        align-items: flex-start;
                        flex-shrink: 1;
                    }

                    [hidden] {
                        display: none;
                    }

                    :host(.globalSidebarDragging) #global[hidden],
                    :host(.contextualSidebarDragging) #contextual[hidden] {
                        display: flex;
                    }

                    #panelsgallerybutton mw-icon {
                        filter: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-panelsgallerybutton-filter);
                        opacity: 0.6;
                    }

                    #panelsgallerybutton:hover mw-icon {
                        opacity: 1;
                    }

                    /* ----- Overflow and Scrolling ----- */
                    .hostContainer {
                        overflow: hidden;
                        scrollbar-width: thin;
                        scrollbar-color: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-scrollbar-track-background-color, #525252) var(--mw-sidebar-rail-scrollbar-thumb-background-color, transparent);
                    }

                    .hostContainer::-webkit-scrollbar {
                        height: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-scrollbar-size, 4px);
                        width: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-scrollbar-size, 4px);
                    }

                    .hostContainer::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
                        background: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-scrollbar-thumb-background-color, transparent);
                    }

                    .hostContainer::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
                        background-color: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-scrollbar-track-background-color, #525252);
                        border-radius: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-scrollbar-thumb-border-radius, 20px);
                        border: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-scrollbar-thumb-border-size, 3px) solid var(--mw-sidebar-rail-scrollbar-thumb-border-color, transparent);
                    }

                    /* ----- Vertical Orientation ----- */
                    :host([orientation="vertical"]) {
                        width: var(--mw-sidebar-fixed-dimension-size, 48px);
                        flex-direction: column;
                    }

                    :host([orientation="vertical"]) .hostContainer {
                        background-image: linear-gradient(to top, var(--mw-sidebar-rail-background-color, #E6E6E6), var(--mw-sidebar-rail-background-color, #E6E6E6)),
                            linear-gradient(to top, var(--mw-sidebar-rail-background-color, #E6E6E6), var(--mw-sidebar-rail-background-color, #E6E6E6)),
                            linear-gradient(to top, var(--mw-color-gray500, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)), var(--mw-color-transparent, transparent)),
                            linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--mw-color-gray500, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)), var(--mw-color-transparent, transparent)); /* TODO: SEMANTICS */
                        background-position: bottom center, top center, bottom center, top center;
                        background-color: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-background-color, #D9D9D9);
                        background-repeat: no-repeat;
                        background-size: 100% 20px, 100% 20px, 100% 10px, 100% 10px;
                        background-attachment: local, local, scroll, scroll;
                        flex-direction: column;
                        flex-grow: 1;
                        align-items: center;
                        padding: 2px 0px;
                    }

                    :host([orientation="vertical"]) ::slotted(*) {
                        margin-top: 4px;
                    }

                    :host([orientation="vertical"]) .hostContainer:hover {
                        overflow-y: auto;
                    }

                    /* When a panel is being dragged then expand the contextual and global drop zones in the Sidebar rail */
                    :host([orientation="vertical"]:not([showpanelsgallerybutton]):not(.globalSidebarDragging)) .hostContainer.contextualPanelPresent,
                    :host([orientation="vertical"][showpanelsgallerybutton]:not(.globalSidebarDragging):not(.contextualSidebarDragging)) .hostContainer,
                    :host([orientation="horizontal"][showpanelsgallerybutton]:not(.globalSidebarDragging):not(.contextualSidebarDragging)) .hostContainer {
                        flex-grow: 0;
                    }

                    :host([orientation="vertical"]) #panelsgallerybutton {
                        justify-content: center;
                        align-items: center;
                        height: 24px;
                        flex-direction: column;
                        padding-top: 2px;
                    }

                    :host([orientation="vertical"]) #panelsgallerybutton::before {
                        border-top-width: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-size, thin);
                        border-top-style: solid;
                        border-top-color: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-color, var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-color-fallback, #000000));
                        content: "";
                        width: 26px;
                        height: 8px;
                    }

                    /* Only show the border if both the "gloabl" and "contextual" rail regions are visible, or we are dragging */
                    :host([orientation="vertical"]) .hostContainer:not([hidden]) + .hostContainer:not([hidden])::before,
                    :host(.globalSidebarDragging[orientation="vertical"]) .hostContainer:not([hidden]) + .hostContainer:not([hidden])::before,
                    :host(.globalSidebarDragging[orientation="vertical"]) .hostContainer[hidden] + .hostContainer:not([hidden])::before,
                    :host(.contextualSidebarDragging[orientation="vertical"]) .hostContainer:not([hidden]) + .hostContainer:not([hidden])::before,
                    :host(.contextualSidebarDragging[orientation="vertical"]) .hostContainer:not([hidden]) + .hostContainer[hidden]::before,
                    :host(.contextualSidebarDragging[orientation="vertical"]) .hostContainer[hidden] + .hostContainer:not([hidden])::before,
                    :host(.contextualSidebarDragging[orientation="vertical"]) .hostContainer[hidden] + .hostContainer[hidden]::before {
                        border-top-width: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-size, thin);
                        border-top-style: solid;
                        border-top-color: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-color, var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-color-fallback, #000000));
                        content: "";
                        width: 26px;
                    }

                    /* ----- Horizontal Orientation ----- */
                    :host([orientation="horizontal"]) {
                        height: var(--mw-sidebar-fixed-dimension-size, 48px);
                        align-items: center;
                    }

                    /*** Add a border to the bottom sidebar only when there is something in the sidebar ***/
                    :host([orientation="horizontal"]) .hostContainer:not([hidden])::before {
                        border-left-width: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-size, thin);
                        border-left-style: solid;
                        border-left-color: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-color, var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-color-fallback, #000000));
                        content: "";
                        height: 22px;
                    }

                    :host([orientation="horizontal"]) .hostContainer {
                        background-image: linear-gradient(to right, var(--mw-sidebar-rail-background-color, #E6E6E6), var(--mw-sidebar-rail-background-color, #E6E6E6)),
                            linear-gradient(to right, var(--mw-sidebar-rail-background-color, #E6E6E6), var(--mw-sidebar-rail-background-color, #E6E6E6)),
                            linear-gradient(to right, var(--mw-color-gray500, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)), var(--mw-color-transparent, transparent)),
                            linear-gradient(to left, var(--mw-color-gray500, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)), var(--mw-color-transparent, transparent)); /* TODO: SEMANTICS */
                        background-position: left center, right center, left center, right center;
                        background-repeat: no-repeat;
                        background-color: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-background-color, #D9D9D9);
                        background-size: 20px 100%, 20px 100%, 10px 100%, 10px 100%;
                        background-attachment: local, local, scroll, scroll;
                        flex-grow: 1;
                        align-items: center;
                        height: var(--mw-sidebar-bottom-rail-height, 30px);
                        padding: 0px 2px;
                    }

                    :host([orientation="horizontal"]) ::slotted(*) {
                        margin-left: 4px;
                    }

                    :host([orientation="horizontal"]) .hostContainer:hover {
                        overflow-x: auto;
                    }

                    /* Only show the border if both the "gloabl" and "contextual" rail regions are visible, or we are dragging */
                    :host([orientation="horizontal"]) .hostContainer:not([hidden]) + .hostContainer:not([hidden])::before,
                    :host(.globalSidebarDragging[orientation="horizontal"]) .hostContainer:not([hidden]) + .hostContainer:not([hidden])::before,
                    :host(.globalSidebarDragging[orientation="horizontal"]) .hostContainer[hidden] + .hostContainer:not([hidden])::before,
                    :host(.contextualSidebarDragging[orientation="horizontal"]) .hostContainer:not([hidden]) + .hostContainer:not([hidden])::before,
                    :host(.contextualSidebarDragging[orientation="horizontal"]) .hostContainer:not([hidden]) + .hostContainer[hidden]::before,
                    :host(.contextualSidebarDragging[orientation="horizontal"]) .hostContainer[hidden] + .hostContainer:not([hidden])::before,
                    :host(.contextualSidebarDragging[orientation="horizontal"]) .hostContainer[hidden] + .hostContainer[hidden]::before {
                        border-left-width: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-size, thin);
                        border-left-style: solid;
                        border-left-color: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-color, var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-color-fallback, #000000));
                        content: "";
                        height: 22px;
                    }

                    :host([orientation="horizontal"]) #panelsgallerybutton {
                        justify-content: center;
                        align-items: center;
                        height: var(--mw-sidebar-bottom-rail-height, 30px);
                        padding-left: 2px;
                    }

                    :host([orientation="horizontal"]) #panelsgallerybutton::before {
                        border-left-width: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-size, thin);
                        border-left-style: solid;
                        border-left-color: var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-color, var(--mw-sidebar-rail-border-color-fallback, #000000));
                        content: "";
                        width: 8px;
                        height: 22px;
                    }

                    :host([orientation="horizontal"]) #panelsgallerybutton::after {
                        content: "";
                        width: 8px;
                        height: 22px;
                    }

                    #global[hidden] + #contextual[hidden] + #panelsgallerybutton {
